cked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":[],"title":"a115/icodes","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b64393a459e845329241e61928992ba6"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_1a9caae5c6a814b2ddf1003b0741221df7c49f37936b0d1bef9b30ae94556021"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: when installing from a cloned repo, Poetry is recommended for dependency management via 'poetry install', and commands are prefixed with 'poetry run python icodes.py'."},{"claim_ids":["clm_30298d82f98ebae25a8a13a4740d32a4b877bb2ef03e651f55bac1adeaca8005"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The tool requires Python 3.11 or higher and is installable via pip as the 'icodes' package."},{"claim_ids":["clm_30db35620469a1b2153e76249e09c65a4e4081e83c651af3fe46796bf1c92f97"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The 'build-index' command generates an indexed database of commit insights for a given Git repository."},{"claim_ids":["clm_36b34bb3978f7b4ca98b7d5d86b83a8f00301b5c132feaf753613f9ec431294d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"iCODES analyzes and indexes Git commit histories using LLM techniques, summarizing commit intents and enabling semantic search over codebases."},{"claim_ids":["clm_726c396279c7108e8fe733963f2dfd93807afe634aad74501443b352d5e8d02e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The CLI provides an 'inspect-repo' command taking a repository path and an optional --branch-name flag; without a branch it uses the current branch and analyzes the latest commit."},{"claim_ids":["clm_78dbc26a8b0f0fbda28f2dc69b3c807cf69f8092254fff86c1c45463758a3c25"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The default model choice of gpt-3.5-turbo appears to reflect a deliberate price/quality tradeoff stated in the documentation."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a371e45e86c7ab740d6c9e2103aa026a480e05b6c95fac133ce82df6d1b81b1b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The only supported LLM backend is OpenAI; the OPENAI_API_KEY environment variable must be exported, and DEFAULT_MODEL selects the GPT model (default gpt-3.5-turbo)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b0bcd6e08240884581039f57c28a44bffac53308425deac55f0d83ac28df2bf3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Semantic search and a web-based UI are listed as 'coming soon' features, indicating they are not yet available in the current tool."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b610db0cc560b83c7711ff8d56320834666d5b40946e53589cfcfbf8bc4b8865"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The tool targets developers seeking to understand and navigate codebases by analyzing commit history, trends, and code evolution patterns."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cfc8d2ffb7b8a827046c85f618bb19433e0e726cacbfca58896e9b28b4b60371"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A 'suggest_commit_message' command retrieves currently staged changes, formats them commit-like, and uses the LLM to suggest a commit message shown in console output."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f266fbf407a1e954f97e1043b4288a7617ef651021341bf16fb41d4fae4ee83b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The 'search' command accepts a query plus optional --author, --file, --start-date, and --end-date filters (dates in YYYY-MM-DD format) to find relevant commits."}],"claim_ids":["clm_1a9caae5c6a814b2ddf1003b0741221df7c49f37936b0d1bef9b30ae94556021","clm_30298d82f98ebae25a8a13a4740d32a4b877bb2ef03e651f55bac1adeaca8005","clm_30db35620469a1b2153e76249e09c65a4e4081e83c651af3fe46796bf1c92f97","clm_36b34bb3978f7b4ca98b7d5d86b83a8f00301b5c132feaf753613f9ec431294d","clm_726c396279c7108e8fe733963f2dfd93807afe634aad74501443b352d5e8d02e","clm_78dbc26a8b0f0fbda28f2dc69b3c807cf69f8092254fff86c1c45463758a3c25","clm_a371e45e86c7ab740d6c9e2103aa026a480e05b6c95fac133ce82df6d1b81b1b","clm_b0bcd6e08240884581039f57c28a44bffac53308425deac55f0d83ac28df2bf3","clm_b610db0cc560b83c7711ff8d56320834666d5b40946e53589cfcfbf8bc4b8865","clm_cfc8d2ffb7b8a827046c85f618bb19433e0e726cacbfca58896e9b28b4b60371","clm_f266fbf407a1e954f97e1043b4288a7617ef651021341bf16fb41d4fae4ee83b"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:29:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_b64393a459e845329241e61928992ba6","id":"pg_bc9b421edc51565d82dece27d4c6dc6f","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/a115-icodes-readme-md-89611